ace, and in the process finds out the reason for her existence.\n\nDuring her travels, she encounters different micro-civilizations, each with their own unique ideology and social structures. Some will teach June while others will hunt her down. She does all of this in the hopes of finding her place amongst the stars.", "summary": "June is a modern fable, presented in the form of a video game. It\u2019s an emotional experience designed with a humanistic approach, that looks at the hero\u2019s journey as an internal struggle between the individual and the collective.\n\nIt is a caricature of our modern times, inspired by that dreaded existential question that we all aspire to respond to: \u201cWhat is my place?\u201d", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/june", "videos": [{"id": 50948, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "IQCHNbwkihI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IQCHNbwkihI", "title": "June : first gameplay video - April 2021", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IQCHNbwkihI/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 50947, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "s67M1EPPJ58", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s67M1EPPJ58", "title": "Trailer - June: Tales from Cyberspace", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/s67M1EPPJ58/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 49227, "name": "Game Intro", "video_id": "uZ4PNZLQn3k", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uZ4PNZLQn3k", "title": "June - Demo#1 : June's abilities (game mechanics tutorial)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uZ4PNZLQn3k/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 51656, "name": "Dev Diary", "video_id": "bmy1jR--584", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bmy1jR--584", "title": "Behind the scene, June: Tales of Cyberspace", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bmy1jR--584/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}